        "assertion": "Managed snapshot identity is deterministically derived from the validated TaskIntent scope envelope, exact HEAD, and canonical staged index entries, with no session state or fallback to the repository-wide dirty snapshot.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.3.14\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/managed-task-snapshot-isolation.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/kernel-intent-authoring.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/kernel-intent-v2.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/kernel-r2c2-reducer.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 180000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 262144\n}\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "acc-unrelated-dirty-isolation",
        "assertion": "Adding, changing, or deleting dirty paths outside the TaskIntent scope envelope does not change the task digest or stale otherwise fresh evidence and approvals, and those paths are neither opened nor included in Review evidence.",
